0294: tearcheck vsync_count follows the panel rate on a 0259 mode 2 switch (new bsd/dev/negroni_dpu.c;
one hunk in NegroniFramebuffer.cpp vrrSetRate)

sde_encoder_phys_cmd.c:1240-1259: vsync_count = 19.2 MHz / (vtotal 2424 x fps): 66 (120 Hz),
88 (90 Hz), 132 (60 Hz). SYNC_CONFIG_VSYNC written with the counter off (bit 19), then on, as
sde_hw_intf.c:646-658 (TE pin bit 20 kept); 0259's
line time (fTeLineNs) follows. Only runs with negronifb_vrr=2; negronifb_tcfg=0 turns it off.
Log: "NEGRONI DPU: tearcheck vsync_count 66 -> 132 for 60 Hz (sync_cfg 0x... -> 0x...)".

